WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:06.974
$227,500, in escrow. The seller can see it is there.

2
00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:12.207
The contract is signed, and the buyer pays into escrow, held by a licensed partner.

3
00:00:12.407 --> 00:00:15.353
Goods shipped: thirty percent is released.

4
00:00:15.553 --> 00:00:20.416
Inspected: another thirty percent. Delivered: the final forty.

5
00:00:20.616 --> 00:00:22.876
Neither side carries the risk alone.

6
00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:25.784
T57. Pay through escrow.
